Package: geosR
Title: Geostatistical and Spatial Helpers for Geoscience
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ghozian", "Karami", , "ghoziankarami@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helpers for variogram fitting, kriging, spatial resource
    calculations, mapping, and distribution transformations using established
    geospatial R packages. Outputs support analysis and preliminary screening.
